  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant#PL50.ANT.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant",
    "canonical_ref": "PL50.ANT.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ecce gaudet Christus et inspicit te; lætantur angeli, et adjuvant te: turba daemonum calcaneum tuum observat; ne deficias, ut dsemones qui nunc lugent, gaudeant.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 438,
    "date_range": [
      437,
      439
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant#PL50.ANT.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant",
    "canonical_ref": "PL50.ANT.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Tecum est omnis chorus martyrum praecessorum tuorum; ex­ spectant te martyres et defendunt, et coronam ex­ tendunt.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 438,
    "date_range": [
      437,
      439
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant#PL50.ANT.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant",
    "canonical_ref": "PL50.ANT.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Rogo te, tene quod tenes, ne alter accipiat coronam tuam (Apoc. XXXI). Quantum temporis est quo pugnaturus eris!",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 438,
    "date_range": [
      437,
      439
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant#PL50.ANT.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant",
    "canonical_ref": "PL50.ANT.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et quantum temporis erit quo in æternum, victurus eris! Jam coepisti, perfice: houie apparet cur pateris;",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 438,
    "date_range": [
      437,
      439
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant#PL50.ANT.2.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant",
    "canonical_ref": "PL50.ANT.2.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dominum nihil latet; non te fallat diabolus in causa, cum tibi ingerit nebulam; hoc vult ne charissimus patiaris.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 438,
    "date_range": [
      437,
