    "work_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant",
    "canonical_ref": "PL50.ANT.6.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Filius itaque suscepit carnem in proprietate, et ta­ men et Pater et Spiritus sanctus non defuerunt ma­ jestate.",
