    "work_id": "oglt-pl/honoratus-constantiensis/pl50_5_ant",
    "canonical_ref": "PL50.ANT.6.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In divinitate aequalitas, in carne Filii pro­ prietas : nec tamen ab eo Patris aut Spiritus sancti recessit divinitas.",
